{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1233836-scion-origin-errata-thread","id":1233836,"title":"Scion: Origin errata thread","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-07-10T16:12:31-07:00","id":1233836,"title":"Scion: Origin errata thread","content":"<b>Scion Book 1: Origin</b> is about to go out to backers. Please report any errata you encounter while reading.<br /> <br /> Please note this thread is only for errata. Typos, incorrect math, page elements that overlap incorrectly, etc. This is not for book discussion. Please take discussion of the book to a different thread. Thank you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T19:14:33-07:00","id":1234134,"title":"","content":"First thing I'm noticing is a weird font glitch, which may be on my end, not sure: Teotl is being consistently rendered as Te tl. Other words that that sequence of letters are fine- Teotihuacan isn't missing the o, for example.<br /> <br /> Leather jacket still just has an &quot;Armored&quot; tag, though there is a note in the armor tag paragraph that all the armor tags are 'armored'. Is the idea that you just get to pick whether it's hard 1 or soft 1? <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12492,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12492-unseenlibrarian","user":"unseenlibrarian","date":".  Adding more. 07-11-2018, 10:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12492-unseenlibrarian","name":"unseenlibrarian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T19:49:57-07:00","id":1234146,"title":"","content":"p. 178: &quot;<b>Abilities </b>are divided into three Arenas and Approaches but are otherwise similar.&quot; -- From context, this is probably meant to be <i>Attributes</i>.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T19:54:19-07:00","id":1234147,"title":"","content":"Page 43 of the book has an odd glitch with the Teotl missing the letter \u201co\u201d. In the section on Mexico City, regarding axes mundi","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24012-sicariothrax","name":"Sicariothrax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T20:03:31-07:00","id":1234148,"title":"","content":"The term &quot;Feat of Scale&quot; appears under Throwing on p. 118, but is never defined. (As far as I can see, that's the only occurrence in the book.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4310-jagardner","name":"jagardner","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"24"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T20:04:50-07:00","id":1234149,"title":"","content":"Page 21. I'm not sure if this is actually wrong but it <i>reads</i> funny.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> For some, it stops there \u2014 culture heroes of great Deeds, but still ultimately mortal. </div> </div> </div>culture heroes of great deeds? It seems like someone accidentally a word.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":"Jetstream","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T20:05:03-07:00","id":1234150,"title":"","content":"Also on page 62-63, chapter 2: On the Storypath system has a test artifact \u201cthe players character should choose a favored approach (pg.XX)\u201d. You might wish to correct this, as it looks out of place","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24012-sicariothrax","name":"Sicariothrax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T20:07:18-07:00","id":1234151,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3487_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3487\" data-vbnamecard=\"3487\">Jetstream</a> I think they mean \u201cgreat cultural heroes\u201d or \u201cheroes of great cultural deeds\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24012-sicariothrax","name":"Sicariothrax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T20:12:40-07:00","id":1234153,"title":"","content":"On the table of content in the section Appendix 2: Pantheons. It is written ''The YorUbA Pantheon''. <br /> I dont know if the upper cases a supposed to be there?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Completed campaign: Scion 2nd Edition. Les L\u00e9gendes Currently playing: Being a dad for a 3 year old daughter and a 2 years old son and now a beautiful new baby.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11312-maitrecorbo","name":"Maitrecorbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11312_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"719"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T20:13:18-07:00","id":1234154,"title":"","content":"The sidebar on ANTAGONISTS AND VARIABLE STUNTS on page 116 uses two examples where neither of the stunts in question are variable; disarm is 2 successes and trip is 1 success. (Maybe change it to establish grapple and feint or shove?)<br /> <br /> The damage stunt on the same page should probably clarify that it's 0 successes+ Soft armor, not just armor, since hard armor doesn't work the same way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12492-unseenlibrarian","name":"unseenlibrarian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T20:26:51-07:00","id":1234156,"title":"","content":"another textual artifact is found on page 99 regarding twists of fate, (Scion: Hero, Pg.XX).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24012-sicariothrax","name":"Sicariothrax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T20:35:39-07:00","id":1234158,"title":"","content":"pg. 167, second column, paragraph under Adjusting Supernatural Paths: it's still saying there should be one more Satyr path and one path reflecting being an animal instead of a human. These were leftovers from the beta script that others pointed out yet didn't get fixed. Either we're still missing two more alternate paths or these need nixed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3071-magusrogue","name":"MagusRogue","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3071_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T20:50:33-07:00","id":1234161,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MagusRogue</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1233836-scion-origin-errata-thread?p=1234158#post1234158\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">pg. 167, second column, paragraph under Adjusting Supernatural Paths: it's still saying there should be one more Satyr path and one path reflecting being an animal instead of a human. These were leftovers from the beta script that others pointed out yet didn't get fixed. Either we're still missing two more alternate paths or these need nixed.</div> </div> </div> </div> yeah I was wondering about this too. Can confirm I\u2019ve seen this section too","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24012-sicariothrax","name":"Sicariothrax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T20:53:54-07:00","id":1234163,"title":"","content":"The Swat and MIB example antagonists still have &quot;Stress&quot; instead of Health.<br /> <br /> Also, as written, the Inflict damage stunt doesn't affect antagonists: it mentions dealing injury conditions (Which antagonists don't suffer from explicitly.) Is there a line I'm maybe missing that out and out says &quot;If you inflict an injury condition on an antagonist fill a box of health instead?&quot; If not, that should probably be in the writeup for the stunt.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12492-unseenlibrarian","name":"unseenlibrarian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T20:53:55-07:00","id":1234164,"title":"","content":"Freya still appears to be missing Beauty? Don't I remember the devs saying that she would have it? Strangely, her brother has it, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">&quot;We have done the impossible, and that makes us mighty.&quot;<br /> Captain Malcolm Reynolds</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/679-unnatural1","name":"unnatural1","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T20:56:28-07:00","id":1234166,"title":"","content":"Page 151, on the subject of Flairs and the sidebar detailing the overview of Purviews. There is a sentence that uses the words mystical sights. This should be mystical sites, as it\u2019s not a verb or description of seeing something. The impression I got was that the sentence should imply places rather than senses.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24012-sicariothrax","name":"Sicariothrax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T20:57:34-07:00","id":1234167,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>unnatural1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1233836-scion-origin-errata-thread?p=1234164#post1234164\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Freya still appears to be missing Beauty? Don't I remember the devs saying that she would have it? Strangely, her brother has it, though.</div> </div> </div> </div>I remember them saying that as well, unless they changed something","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24012-sicariothrax","name":"Sicariothrax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T21:15:22-07:00","id":1234171,"title":"","content":"Hey folks, can you please keep your posts here to reporting errata rather than discussing it? Feel free to start a new thread for discussions, though. Thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T21:23:14-07:00","id":1234173,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RichT</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1233836-scion-origin-errata-thread?p=1234171#post1234171\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey folks, can you please keep your posts here to reporting errata rather than discussing it? Feel free to start a new thread for discussions, though. Thanks!</div> </div> </div> </div> apologies, my lord. I will honor your request","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24012-sicariothrax","name":"Sicariothrax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T21:26:51-07:00","id":1234174,"title":"","content":"pg 178, top right: &quot;Intelligence is now Intellect, and Wits and Perception and folded together into Cunning.&quot; I imagine that last 'and' should be an 'are.'","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13075-malicwanderer","name":"MalicWanderer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13075_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T21:28:41-07:00","id":1234175,"title":"","content":"Hassan still doesn't work RAW. I know npcs don't need to conform to player character creation rules, but the point of example ready-made pcs is that they do. An unvisited Scion of Loki can't take Healer. His 1 Calling dot needs to be in Liminal, Lover, or Trickster. Given his radical shift in location and circumstances, and his current work as a driver, I'd suggest Liminal, but any of the three work RAW.<br /> <br /> (alternate option: drop the requirement that unvisited Scions one Path dot come from a parent's path, have that tie in be something that comes with the Visitation; if it's important that Hassan have his dot in Healer, than that's a reason the rule shouldn't be so restrictive on similarly divergent-from-parent player character concepts either)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T21:34:34-07:00","id":1234176,"title":"","content":"Pages 163-167 have more text artifacts in the supernatural origin paths likely related to section on callings and knacks in the beta draft of Hero, and it looks like they are missing page numbers. The entries for the Hulder, Deer woman and therianthropes each have a placeholder citation that needs to be looked at.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24012-sicariothrax","name":"Sicariothrax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T22:27:35-07:00","id":1234177,"title":"","content":"Page 122, Scale section of combat. The paragraphs on the right column is duplicated for the &quot;Damage and Scale&quot; entry immediately after, with only very slight changes.<br /> <br /> Page 125, Armor examples. The Kevlar vest tallies to 4 points, while armors should have a max of 3. Chainmail shirt tallies to 5.<br /> <br /> Page 146, Armor sidebar, indicates that Soft Armor functions as usual, increasing Defense, but that isn't actually what soft armor does according to the armor section of the book - it increases the difficulty of the inflict damage stunt by 1, while other stunts would be unaffected.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2433-highpriest","name":"HighPriest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2433_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T22:32:31-07:00","id":1234178,"title":"","content":"Page 107, Healer Knack Doctor's Kit, Swift Bandaging should read &quot;Remove an Injured Injury&quot;, not &quot;Remove a Injured Injury&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2433-highpriest","name":"HighPriest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2433_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T22:48:49-07:00","id":1234181,"title":"","content":"Page 104, both Sneak and Technology Expert have &quot;Enigmas&quot; listed under their associated skills.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24100-el_borco","name":"El_borco","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T22:50:18-07:00","id":1234182,"title":"","content":"In the opening story, during the narration about Donnie and the Russian gymnast, it should read \u201c back then, the athlete had pre-empted him by passing Donnie hers first, but now, Donnie could feel himself reaching for a pen and a napkin.\u201c on page four.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24012,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24012-sicariothrax","user":"Sicariothrax","date":".  Clarity. Again. 07-12-2018, 01:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24012-sicariothrax","name":"Sicariothrax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T22:57:01-07:00","id":1234185,"title":"","content":"In the Second Appendix, the entry for Freya has her with the Death, Prosperity, &amp; Fertility callings, no such callings exist.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/258-thesarcasticsage","name":"TheSarcasticSage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar258_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T23:02:59-07:00","id":1234186,"title":"","content":"Pg 173, in Sarutahiko's list of titles, Ama-No-Uzume is misspelled.<br /> <br /> Page 174, the health purview from Goibniu is on the same line as Lugh's name.<br /> <br /> Also page 174, both Oduduwa and Oshossi have formatting errors.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24100-el_borco","name":"El_borco","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T23:03:25-07:00","id":1234187,"title":"","content":"Pg 70: There's a p. XX and a Scion: Hero, p. xx at the bottom of the Momentum Virtues sidebar.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13075-malicwanderer","name":"MalicWanderer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13075_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T23:16:25-07:00","id":1234190,"title":"","content":"In the Appendix, Nana\u2019b\u2019oozoo only has two Callings: Hunter and Trickster. (In the Hero KS Preview, the third was Warrior)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://twitter.com/carykingdom\" target=\"_blank\">@CaryKingdom </a>- Writer and Ne'er-do-well<br /> Deititian at <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/category/worlds/scion/\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Second Edition</a><br /> Storyguide of <a href=\"https://scabbyrooster.fandom.com/wiki/The_Demi_Dozen\" target=\"_blank\">The Demi Dozen</a>, a Hero-level, live-streamed Scion Campaign<br /> Everything is subject to change; all opinions expressed are solely my own or those of my houseplants.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1093-arlecchino","name":"Arlecchino","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T23:21:33-07:00","id":1234192,"title":"","content":"Pg. 65. Too Many Cooks sidebar. &quot;Too much help tends to make the task more difficult, balancing out the additional sources of aid...&quot; Should be &quot;Too much help tends to make the task more <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">easy</span>, balancing out the additional sources of aid","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9129-iamrpgdm","name":"iamrpgdm","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T23:54:05-07:00","id":1234197,"title":"","content":"Page 151, the Sorcery Without Heroism sidebar... It mentions a Plants Purview, which should probably be Wild.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1344-samudra","name":"Samudra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1344_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"497"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T00:01:18-07:00","id":1234200,"title":"","content":"P.117 lists Agility(Might) as the skill for Grapple.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2472-trebius","name":"trebius","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2472_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T00:43:37-07:00","id":1234207,"title":"","content":"I feel like I should mention that the &quot;Page XX&quot; notes are a known thing, last I heard, and very much deliberate. They'll put in numbers when the editing passes are done and they don't have to change the page numbers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T02:36:13-07:00","id":1234217,"title":"","content":"Artemis still doesn't have Wild?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">&quot;We have done the impossible, and that makes us mighty.&quot;<br /> Captain Malcolm Reynolds</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/679-unnatural1","name":"unnatural1","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T03:58:51-07:00","id":1234236,"title":"","content":"P.117. Inflict Damage for Grapple and Ranged Attack doesn't mention armor, like Close Combat's Inflict Damage on P.116, which implies that armor isn't effective against Grapple and Ranged Attacks. It may be that Grapple's Inflict Damage <i>does </i>ignore armor (crushing the opponent inside their armor, etc)., in which case it should be specifically called out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/972-fairlyhyperman","name":"Fairlyhyperman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar972_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T04:03:19-07:00","id":1234238,"title":"","content":"I am very confused by the decision to use They/Them pronouns with Loki on page 51 of Scion Hero, I mean yes Loki is a shapeshifter but as far as I am aware he has always been presented as a man who shapeshifted and not a they. Would it not be more appropriate to either use male pronouns for him?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2792-drucchi","name":"Drucchi","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T04:12:08-07:00","id":1234239,"title":"","content":"Well-Tempered and Motorcycle Jacket both use the &quot;Armored&quot; tag, and its ambiguous as to what that means. (From context, I assume it to be Soft Armor). Well Tempered is also worded a bit weirdly, as the circumstantial bonus that stacks with armor only exists when you're not wearing Armor.<br /> <br /> The Range table on p120 lists &quot;Discipline&quot; as the Combat Attribute for Long range.<br /> <br /> The &quot;Empty the Clip&quot; stunt doesn't seem to be aware of the Ammunition Check rules later in the chapter. (It says you just flat run out of ammo, the Automatic Tag says you make successive Out of Ammo checks.)<br /> <br /> Many movement options allow the use of Might or Dexterity, so some of the Pregens should have more movement dice.<br /> <br /> Virtue rules are somewhat muddy. The sidebar on page 70 suggests that invoking a virtue can be done with any virtue-appropriate action and doesn't actually give any numbers as to what the bonus is. The rules on page 163 suggest you have to be end on a far end of the track to have the Virtuous Condiiton, in order to benefit from extra dice.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/526-schizopop","name":"schizoPOP","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"108"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T05:48:19-07:00","id":1234255,"title":"","content":"The text on <i>Specialties </i>is inconsistent; <b>Page 97</b> (Character Creation) describes them as eligible for Skills with 3 or more dots and adding Enhancement 1 to rolls with other Skills; <b>Page 59</b> (Skill Specialties sidebar) describes them as eligible for Skills with 4 or more dots and adding Enhancement 1 only to rolls with that same Skill (unless it would add up to more than Enhancement 3). In addition, it is unclear whether or not a character can have multiple Specialties in the same Skill.<br /> <br /> <b>Page 51</b>; The non-sidebar text at the very end of Chapter One: The World is cut off, there's about half a paragraph missing after an incomplete sentence, compared to the Origins raw text preview. The sentence in question is &quot;Two nations might be destined to go to war, and there\u2019s nothing anybody can do about it \u2014 meddling just makes it worse, the way irritation in an oyster (...)&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":188,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","user":"YeOfLittleFaith","date":". 07-12-2018, 09:09 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","name":"YeOfLittleFaith","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar188_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T05:56:00-07:00","id":1234257,"title":"","content":"In the Kami appendix on page 173 the entry for Satutahiko lists four Callings: Liminal, Lover, Sage and Warrior.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12689-creepyshutin","name":"CreepyShutIn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12689_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T08:17:05-07:00","id":1234293,"title":"","content":"In the range bands table on page120, Long range uses the combat attribute Determination. A search in the entire file shows this is the only place where Determination is used. Should this be Resolve? The preview in January showed Medium as Dexterity or Cunning, and Long range as Cunning.<br /> <br /> Edit: schizoPOP found this one first.<br /> Edit 2: if you read the text, Long still uses Cunning. The table is wrong, but the text is not.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23791,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23791-ashnak","user":"Ashnak","date":". 07-16-2018, 02:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23791-ashnak","name":"Ashnak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T09:37:39-07:00","id":1234309,"title":"","content":"Pg 11, end of first non-italics paragraph: &quot;The World today is a very different place than <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">the</span> anything our ancestors could have conceived.&quot;<br /> <br /> Edit: Same page, bottom right, &quot;The World of<br /> Legend exists alongside <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">The world</span> of humanity, creating<br /> a continuous line from ancient to modern mythology.&quot;<br /> Feel like either that T needs to be lower case or the w needs to be capitalized.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13075,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13075-malicwanderer","user":"MalicWanderer","date":". 07-12-2018, 02:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13075-malicwanderer","name":"MalicWanderer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13075_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T10:54:34-07:00","id":1234332,"title":"","content":"Pg 83, <b>Not so Fast</b> sidebar: &quot;flip back to p. XX&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7395-meribson","name":"Meribson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7395_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T11:30:04-07:00","id":1234339,"title":"","content":"Pg 178, \u200b&quot;abilities or item or circumstances that grant even more successes&quot; Should likely be &quot;An item&quot;, or &quot;items&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5172-navar","name":"Navar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5172_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T11:39:17-07:00","id":1234341,"title":"","content":"The sidebar on virtues is unclear as to how many bonus dice are received when spending momentum in the name of your virtues and the example just repeats the same information with a name attached to it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Call Me <b>Ray</b>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://southern-gothic.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Southern Gothic </a>- Welcome to New Calais","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/256-gnomish-american","name":"Gnomish American","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar256_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"569"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T11:46:46-07:00","id":1234348,"title":"","content":"p. 44: The name of the city of Salvador is misspelled. The right should be &quot;S\u00e3o Salvador&quot;, not &quot;Sao S\u00e3lvador&quot;. What, btw, I not even wonder how can be pronounced.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23841-hayashi","name":"Hayashi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23841_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"121"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T12:07:46-07:00","id":1234352,"title":"","content":"p. 30 sidebar &quot;They <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">almost</span> possess powerful, implacable, and incorruptible guards.&quot; I suspect this was intended as either &quot;almost always&quot; or simply &quot;always&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6513-maltry","name":"Maltry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6513_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"34"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T12:09:11-07:00","id":1234354,"title":"","content":"p. 123: The injury conditions mentioned in the \u201cBashing\u201d and \u201cLethal\u201d tags don\u2019t match those given in the \u201cResolving Damage\u201d section above.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/40-dspaul","name":"DSPaul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T12:49:45-07:00","id":1234365,"title":"","content":"p. 34, in the final paragraph of the overworld section. &quot;A Primordial\u2019s inhabitants <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">are</span> include Elementals,&quot; that &quot;are&quot; should probably be removed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6513-maltry","name":"Maltry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6513_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"34"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T13:04:32-07:00","id":1234371,"title":"","content":"p. 35, in the first paragraph under the Strange Places header. &quot;They might be products of <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Legendbinding</span>, errant magic, or inscrutable Fate.&quot; As a capitalized word &quot;Legendbinding&quot; seems to reference a specific game mechanic. But, I am not aware of any such mechanic, and the term is not used elsewhere in the book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6513-maltry","name":"Maltry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6513_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"34"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T13:10:26-07:00","id":1234374,"title":"","content":"Pg 122, &quot;Storyguides, be sparing when hitting <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">an </span>PC and use the extra successes as much as possible&quot; should probably be &quot;a PC.&quot; Also, that section never states how many successes the extra inflict damages allowed by Scale should cost. (That sentence makes me think 2, personally, but I'm not in charge.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13075-malicwanderer","name":"MalicWanderer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13075_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T14:19:28-07:00","id":1234399,"title":"","content":"On page 116. In the defending section it mentions defense is by default 1 and you may stunt to increase it. However, the defend stunt itself says that the number to overcome is equal to your successes and zero successes is 1. This wording somewhat implies that its replacing rather than adding to your base of 1 defense and that rolling 1 or 0 successes is the exaxt same thing. Essentially 1 success is simply ignored.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9236-yig1015w","name":"Yig1015w","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"182"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T15:38:42-07:00","id":1234423,"title":"","content":"p.2 &quot;model/actor/whatever&quot; seems more appropriate than &quot;model-actor-whatever&quot;<br /> p.6 Introductory Fiction <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">by</span>: \u201cApple,\u201d <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">by </span>Kieron Gillen; \u201cEileen\u201d <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">by </span>Lauren Roy<br /> p.6 Special Thanks: who\u2019s doing the thanking? Neall?<br /> p.6 \u201cKeep up to date with Onyx Path Publishing at theonyxpath.com\u201d should that be a link?<br /> p.12 \u201cA mood of <i>heroism</i>, of greatness and grandeur\u201d comma appears to be bolded<br /> p.12 \u201cfor a Scion cannot help but be great in some manner, and inevitably find themselves venerated by culture.\u201d \u201cfor Scions\u2026\u201d or \u201c...finds themself\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18839-zilaenor","name":"zilaenor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T16:14:42-07:00","id":1234435,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sicariothrax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1233836-scion-origin-errata-thread?p=1234182#post1234182\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In the opening story, during the narration about Donnie and the Russian gymnast, it should read \u201c back then, the athlete had pre-empted him by passing Donnie hers first, but now, Donnie could feel himself reaching for a pen and a napkin.\u201c on page four.</div> </div> </div> </div>Pretty sure that\u2019s meant as confirmation that Donnie is bisexual or pansexual.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3961-thrythlind","name":"Thrythlind","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T16:50:34-07:00","id":1234442,"title":"","content":"The writeup for the Dahomey Amazons does not contain their actual Fon name, the Mino, and only has the name given to them by Europeans, the Dahomey Amazons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1778-morsrattus","name":"MorsRattus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1778_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"189"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T16:57:36-07:00","id":1234446,"title":"","content":"Page 116, Defending and Defense Stunts. The section says that you can use Defense to increase the difficulty that an attack must overcome to hit you, but this does not seem to be the case as the Defend stunt only increases the number of successes required for the Inflict Injury stunt. If this IS supposed to raise the difficulty of the attacker to hit the character, does this mean that a single success used for Defense does absolutely nothing? (I.e., giving a Difficulty to Hit of 1, which all characters innately have.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/728-crownedsun","name":"CrownedSun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar728_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"217"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T17:37:36-07:00","id":1234459,"title":"","content":"Page 58, Academics. ''Academics + <b>Reason</b> also represents the total number of languages a character can maintain fluency in without constant effort.'' <br /> I'm guessing instead of Reason one should read Intellect?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Completed campaign: Scion 2nd Edition. Les L\u00e9gendes Currently playing: Being a dad for a 3 year old daughter and a 2 years old son and now a beautiful new baby.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11312-maitrecorbo","name":"Maitrecorbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11312_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"719"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T18:40:23-07:00","id":1234485,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Thrythlind</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1233836-scion-origin-errata-thread?p=1234435#post1234435\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Pretty sure that\u2019s meant as confirmation that Donnie is bisexual or pansexual.</div> </div> </div> </div>Correct; Donnie is attractive to everyone, and attracted to everyone.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Neall Raemonn Price</span><br /> Beleaguered Scion Developer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/137-neall","name":"Neall","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1204"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T20:32:03-07:00","id":1234510,"title":"","content":"In the section of Mexico City. Whenever Teotl is brought up it is missing the o","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","name":"Iceblade44","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"707"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T20:43:40-07:00","id":1234511,"title":"","content":"Page 36: Few gates directly connect The World to Godsrealms, and the exceptions <b><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">are </span></b>either pass through other realms attuned to the same mythology, or were made for the Gods\u2019 convenience, and are nearly impossible for anyone else to use.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T22:41:02-07:00","id":1234544,"title":"","content":"p.16 \u201cBand: A group of Scions, whether from a single pantheon or multiple<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">s</span>.\u201d<br /> p.16 \u201cPrimordial: A <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">God </span>of\u201d deity seems more apt<br /> p.17 \u201cHuginn/Muninn, etc. Also\u201d needs another period<br /> p.19 \u201cDon\u2019t get caught up on wondering which one is correct: <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">T</span>hey all are.\u201d<br /> p.20 \u201cdefining the boundary between what the God is and what isn\u2019t.\u201d \u201cit isn\u2019t\u201d<br /> p.21 \u201cso in apotheosis the Scion sacrifices her humanity and embraces the elemental forces that come to define him.\u201d Intentional gender switch?<br /> p.31 \u201cthough in case where the Gods punish or purify them\u201d cases<br /> p.34 \u201cThese Eidolons are bright and strong, unlike the Underworld\u2019s grim shades.\u201d Usually \u201cShades\u201d<br /> p.35 \u201cAnyone can enter or leave, so lost mortals enter, rival territorial claims plague anyone who tried to own them, and errant phenomena leak out.\u201d tries<br /> <br /> Glossary lacks some terms which show up in the text much earlier than their explanations. Deeds, Axes Mundi, Touchstone","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18839-zilaenor","name":"zilaenor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-13T06:49:32-07:00","id":1234618,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Drucchi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1233836-scion-origin-errata-thread?p=1234238#post1234238\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am very confused by the decision to use They/Them pronouns with Loki on page 51 of Scion Hero, I mean yes Loki is a shapeshifter but as far as I am aware he has always been presented as a man who shapeshifted and not a they. Would it not be more appropriate to either use male pronouns for him?</div> </div> </div> </div>Having read a few of the easily available myths, the stories generally refer to Loki by name or by the gender they're currently presenting as. When Loki is shapeshifted into a woman, the story uses female pronouns and when a man the story uses male pronouns. For a general reference to Loki in an unknown state, it works best just to use They/Them. By the same token, the Inari description just doesn't use pronouns at all because Inari is gonna Inari, y'all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3961-thrythlind","name":"Thrythlind","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-13T07:46:35-07:00","id":1234637,"title":"","content":"Page 109: You can inspire a number of people equal to <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b>her</b></span> Leadership","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-13T10:04:00-07:00","id":1234687,"title":"","content":"Page 42 is missing the &quot;o&quot; in Teotl in all occurrences.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Lead Writer for the Savage Age of Werewolf: the Apocalypse: <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/428750/Ghost-Lineages-The-Advanced-Players-Guide-to-the-Savage-Age\" target=\"_blank\">Ghost Lineages</a>, <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/312700/The-Rise-of-the-Garou-The-Savage-Age-Volume-Two\" target=\"_blank\">Rise of the Garou</a>, <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/331302/Tools-of-Extinction-The-Savage-Age-Volume-Three\" target=\"_blank\">Tools of Extinction</a>, <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/352717/Tribebook-Wlewa\" target=\"_blank\">Tribebook: Wlewa</a>.<br /> <br /> Want RPGs in libraries? Check out my book, <a href=\"http://www.abc-clio.com/ABC-CLIOCorporate/product.aspx?pc=A3951P\" target=\"_blank\">Dragons in the Stacks</a>. Now with <a href=\"http://www.ennie-awards.com/blog/2015-ennie-award-nominees-and-spotlight-winners/\" target=\"_blank\">awards</a>!<br /> \u200b","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1813-grimjaws","name":"grimjaws","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1813_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-13T11:16:20-07:00","id":1234710,"title":"","content":"Just logging in to present what my sleep-deprived brain has locked onto.<br /> <br /> On the Ready Made Characters, there are some problems with their Specialties, but the rules for Specialties don't agree. On page 59, the sidebar at the top of the page says &quot;...once a character reaches <u><i>four or more dots</i></u> in a Skill they may choose a Specialty focus...&quot; On page 97 the text reads, &quot;For every Skill that ends up with <u><i>three or more dots</i></u>, choose a Specialty. <br /> <br /> This throws some confusion on the Ready Made Characters that could use some clarification: Eric Donner has Pilot 3 (Driving Cars). Emanuel Montero has Academics 2 (Aztech History), Empathy 3 (Sympathy) and an errant, '<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">M</span>' next to Technology. Hassan al-Hakim has Empathy rated at <u>zero dots</u> with Bedside Manner as a Specialty, and the rules don't tell us how that would work (presumably boosting success from just the Attribute). Rashmi Battacharya has Culture 3 (the Hinduisms - which should be Hindi Tenets or Hindi Dharmas according to several associates), as well as Firearms 3 (Rifles). All three of Rhiannon Jernigan's Specialties are attached to Skills rated 3.<br /> <br /> On pg 123, formatting gaff on the Brutal (1) entry: entry is not bold, nor does it conform to the alternating greyscale bands and subsequently throws off the rest of the table.<br /> <br /> On pg 151, the &quot;Sorcery Without Heroism&quot; sidebar, parenthetical reference: &quot;(whether directly from a God, stealing it from a relic or artifact, or draining it from a mystical <b><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">sight</span></b>)&quot; I feel this is intended to be 'site,' unless the sorcerer is stealing essence from a prophetic vision or other divination; if this is the case, it needs to be clearer.<br /> <br /> On pg 163, Virtuous Condition: &quot; Momentum: Every time your Virtue <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b>rage</b></span> causes trouble, add another point of Momentum into thepool.&quot; I think 'rage' is meant to be 'range,' as in the two polarized Virtues embraced by your culture/pantheon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3108,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3108-malckuss","user":"Malckuss","date":".  Additional findings 07-13-2018, 03:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3108-malckuss","name":"Malckuss","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-13T11:39:51-07:00","id":1234723,"title":"","content":"They forgot to add beauty to the female Aesir while males get it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-13T11:42:53-07:00","id":1234725,"title":"","content":"Disregard. I missed the message about page XXs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Lead Writer for the Savage Age of Werewolf: the Apocalypse: <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/428750/Ghost-Lineages-The-Advanced-Players-Guide-to-the-Savage-Age\" target=\"_blank\">Ghost Lineages</a>, <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/312700/The-Rise-of-the-Garou-The-Savage-Age-Volume-Two\" target=\"_blank\">Rise of the Garou</a>, <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/331302/Tools-of-Extinction-The-Savage-Age-Volume-Three\" target=\"_blank\">Tools of Extinction</a>, <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/352717/Tribebook-Wlewa\" target=\"_blank\">Tribebook: Wlewa</a>.<br /> <br /> Want RPGs in libraries? Check out my book, <a href=\"http://www.abc-clio.com/ABC-CLIOCorporate/product.aspx?pc=A3951P\" target=\"_blank\">Dragons in the Stacks</a>. Now with <a href=\"http://www.ennie-awards.com/blog/2015-ennie-award-nominees-and-spotlight-winners/\" target=\"_blank\">awards</a>!<br /> \u200b","edited":{"userid":1813,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1813-grimjaws","user":"grimjaws","date":". 07-13-2018, 02:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1813-grimjaws","name":"grimjaws","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1813_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-13T12:02:23-07:00","id":1234730,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Malckuss</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1233836-scion-origin-errata-thread?p=1234710#post1234710\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">On pg 163, Virtuous Condition: &quot; Momentum: Every time your Virtue <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b>rage</b></span> causes trouble, add another point of Momentum into thepool.&quot; I think 'rage' is meant to be 'range,' as in the two polarized Virtues embraced by your culture/pantheon.</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually, 'rage' as in being consumed by one Virtue is probably what they meant. When you're inflicted by the Virtuous condition you're in the grips of one Virtue","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-13T20:41:37-07:00","id":1234861,"title":"","content":"Pg. 144: &quot;It\u2019s unsatisfying for most players to think that their characters\u2019 stories, and it leaves the driving idea of heroes\u2019 journeys out of their personal growth.&quot;<br /> <br /> Should probably be &quot;It\u2019s unsatisfying for most players to think that of their characters\u2019 stories, and it leaves the driving idea of heroes\u2019 journeys out of their personal growth.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1596-horngeek","name":"horngeek","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1596_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"241"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-13T22:24:48-07:00","id":1234869,"title":"","content":"Not exactly an errata and more to a doubt. The character sheet has in the down right corner a stat: &quot;Movement Dice&quot;. Or I absolutely missed this mechanic, or that's a mistake.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23841-hayashi","name":"Hayashi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23841_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"121"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-14T06:16:50-07:00","id":1234925,"title":"","content":"Pg. 96 Under Character Creation:<br /> <br /> - Group, contact, and access connections (p. XX).<br /> - A Path Condition that triggers when you invoke the Path too often (p. XX). You can choose one of the example Conditions or use them as a template to create your own.<br /> <br /> Two references to p. XX that need to be addressed","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/>